    }
  ],
  "current_gap_vs_cg": "CG-001–005 remain necessary but insufficient. Dual-star Qwen 24小时/封闭/外包/每日/门禁卡/项目经理批示 and Grok 固定岗落位/不预填 would still PASS today."
